      "effect": "costs",
      "direction": null,
      "quote": "A corporation that makes independent political expenditures over $10,000 in a calendar year shall publicly disclose",
      "mechanism": "Corporations engaging in this spending must track and report individual donor information, adding an administrative paperwork burden.",
      "certainty": "stated"
